/ A task written where a task was keeps it: %task.list% is every task written there, in order, and wait for
/ %task.list% answers all their results in that order.
Start
- goal.call(Name="First", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%task%, Value=%!data%)
- goal.call(Name="Second", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%task%, Value=%!data%)
- task.wait(List=%task.list%); variable.set(Name=%results%, Value=%!data%)
- assert.equals(Expected="first", Actual=%results[0]%, Message="the task written first")
- assert.equals(Expected="second", Actual=%results[1]%, Message="the task written last")

First
- timer.sleep(Duration="200ms")
- goal.return(Data="first")

Second
- goal.return(Data="second")
